},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTExNzQwMi8zMDYzNzA4OS5qcGc=/original/qSShCX.jpg","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io page. The film-derived robot design retains the project-only restrictions recorded in the creator’s NOTICE.md.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/claude-dreaming-godot.webp","alt","Claude Dreaming gameplay showing a robot floating near a small planet in purple space.","https://rusty-production.itch.io/claude-dreaming","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[93],"Claude 模型 / 对话","相关资源",[98],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":99,"_25":100},"Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/zh/resources/godot-engine/","创作者开发记录",[104],"evidence",{"_62":105,"_25":82,"_106":107},"查看作者的 AI 开发分工说明","note","The creator explicitly credits Claude and discloses assisted code, graphics, sounds, and text. This is an author disclosure and contribution workflow, not a complete development transcript.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[112],{"_62":113,"_25":114,"_106":115},"查看完整 Godot 项目","https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming","Full scenes, GDScript, levels, rooms, assets, film intro, and export presets. Run with Godot 4.7.2 standard: import project.godot and press F5. Code is MIT; original assets are CC BY 4.0, while film material and film-derived art have project-only restrictions in NOTICE.md.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[121],{"_62":122,"_25":82,"_106":123},"Play Claude Dreaming","In-development HTML5 game. WASD moves; mouse looks, Space jumps/glides, E enters paintings, R respawns, and Esc pauses. Menus are German; Claude speaks English. The film intro can be skipped.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","教程","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[131],{"_62":132,"_25":133,"_106":-7},"阅读用 Claude 添加梦境的指南","https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[138,139,140,141],"Start the browser build; hold Enter to skip the film if desired.","Enter a painting and compare its movement with the attic and community rooms.","Import the full project in Godot 4.7.2 standard, then read the level template and contribution guide.","Create one small level through the published API and test entry, movement, respawn, and returning to the attic.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Rusty 将作品署名为 Rusty 与 Claude，并披露代码、图像、声音和文字均有 AI 辅助。仓库提供贡献说明与关卡接口，方便继续与 Claude 一起制作新梦境。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Godot 4.7 · GDScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[138,139,140,141],{"_62":171,"_25":133,"_17":128},{"_62":122,"_25":82,"_17":117,"_106":123},{"_62":168,"_25":114,"_169":170,"_106":115},{"_62":167,"_25":82,"_106":107},[166],"godot-engine","Read the creator’s AI contribution disclosure","Open the complete Godot project","scope","complete-project","Read how to add a dream with Claude",{"_173":174},"documents",{"_74":175,"_35":176},[178,182,183,184,181,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,180,217,179,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235],[177,178,179,180,181],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay